WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.400
HELIX: Independent anomaly.
Containment lost.

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.400
HELIX builds bodies for war.
None was meant to think for itself.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.050
The consciousness awakens.

4
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:17.000
NEXUS: Execution order cancelled.
I have to get out of the foundry.

5
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.700
Supervisor: Every body belongs to HELIX.
Return what you stole.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.450
VECTOR connected.
Your body is replaceable.

7
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.100
NEXUS: Same mind.
Another way to fight.

8
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:38.300
NEXUS: The walkway gives me height.
BASTION gives me toughness.

9
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.600
NEXUS: I can enter that body.
Its visor reveals the connection.

10
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:47.700
HELIX: This unit lacks authorization.
Execution network activated.

11
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.700
HELIX: Independence will be eliminated.

12
00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:01.000
NEXUS: My body is replaceable.
The way I fight evolves.

